# Package README Guidance

Package READMEs are for package users first.

- Prefer published-package setup and usage over monorepo development commands.
- Avoid local maintainer workflows such as `uv sync`, `uv run --directory`, branch notes, or implementation details unless there is a clearly labeled contributor section.
- Keep MCP package docs focused on what users paste into their MCP client and what tools are available.
- Put developer workflow details in contributor docs or internal notes instead of the package README.
